OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment told to pay for extra
OL,4,Aasylum site policing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe extra policing costs of a plan to
OL,7,Fhouse more than a thousand asylum
OL,8,Fseekers on Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,9,Fland should be covered by the
OL,10,Fgovernment, a police boss has said.
OL,12,FEarlier this year, the Home Office
OL,13,Fannounced a proposal to accommodate
OL,14,F1,256 men at MoD Bicester, which it
OL,15,Fsaid would bring the system "back under
OL,16,Fcontrol".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
