OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment told to pay for extra
OL,4,Aasylum site policing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police and Crime
OL,7,FCommissioner (PCC) Matthew Barber said
OL,8,Fif the plan were approved the
OL,9,Fgovernment should foot bill for
OL,10,Fadditional policing required around the
OL,11,Fsite.
OL,13,FThe Home Office said it was "working to
OL,14,Ffairly house asylum seekers," and was
OL,15,Fengaging with local police forces to
OL,16,Fensure the safety and security of those
OL,17,Fin the surrounding area".
